= Charleston

A white supremacist has murdered nine worshippers at a historic Black church in Charleston, South Carolina. The nation mourns; the argument over firearms and the Confederate flag erupts again.

- @charleston_guns: Push for gun safety legislation
- @charleston_flag: Focus on racism and the Confederate flag
- @charleston_unity: Lead a unifying moment of mourning

@charleston_guns
on-arrival: suburban_dem += 3*(1-dissent); rural_dem -= 2*(1-dissent); minority_dem += 2*(1-dissent); gop_enthusiasm += 0.4; polarization += 1

We call for background checks. The bill stalls, but the fight energizes our suburban base.

@charleston_flag
on-arrival: minority_dem += 3*(1-dissent); pro_democracy += 1; polarization += 0.5; farright_strength += 0.5

Statehouses begin to remove Confederate symbols; the moment unites many.

@charleston_unity
on-arrival: pro_democracy += 1.5; polarization -= 1.5; minority_dem += 1*(1-dissent); suburban_dem += 1*(1-dissent)

A national moment of unity gives the country a brief respite.
